{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1028415-ghosthunting-equipment","id":1028415,"title":"Ghosthunting equipment?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-07T20:57:10-08:00","id":1028415,"title":"Ghosthunting equipment?","content":"I could swear I saw ghost-hunting equipment in one of the WoD books (the psuedo-scientific kind, like you see on ghost hunter tv shows in real life), but now I can't find it anywhere. Can anyone tip me off as to what book(s)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12390-gadren","name":"gadren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T22:20:43-08:00","id":1028432,"title":"","content":"There's the Etheric Rounds, Etheric Goggles and Etheric Tracker from the Core section of Hunter on Advanced Armory. I also suggest you take a look at Reighnhell's <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\"><b>Relics thread</b></a>. It has some Relics for dealing with ghosts. Reighnhell also wrote <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/349384-think-of-fictional-characters-and-say-what-they-would-be-in-cofd?p=499559#post499559\"><b>stats for the special Equipment of the Ghostbusters</b></a>, which you can use as inspiration. There's also the Esoteric Armory Merit from page 139 of CoD. You should check out Amechra's <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760764-which-supernatural-style-comes-next?p=834214#post834214\"><b>Hardened Exorcist Style</b></a>. Just replace Occult with Science and the magic circles with pseudo-scientific gadgets and you're golden. Finally, Claire Redfield wrote <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/570057-fatal-frame-camera-obscura\"><b>stats for the Camera Obscura from Fatal Frame</b></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T07:32:22-08:00","id":1028540,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Ghost Hunting</b><br /> <br /> Thanks for the Shout out! There is also a section for supernatural equipment in the <b>God Machine Rules Update </b>[pg 241 - 243] - it covers classic ghost hunting tools like Energy meters and Kirlian Cameras.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T03:56:38-08:00","id":1028952,"title":"","content":"If memory serves in compacts and conspiracies Network Zero had an endowment that would let them detect monsters through different forms of media (this is if they were being updated into a conspiracy). It mentioned listening devices being tuned into ghost's frequency so you could hear them, but that was just an example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T05:54:25-08:00","id":1028986,"title":"","content":"As for the actual stuff you mentioned, like EVP devices and such, I'm pretty sure that was in the core rulebook in the equipment section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"htt